  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Moogs_Soaring_Structure/BH_MSS_header.webp\" alt=\"橫幅\"></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fD1D8LKA5N\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://ko-fi.com/img/githubbutton_sm.svg\" alt=\"Ko-fi\"></a></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fS5nffJbuvA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/869218732650688543?color=14822e&amp;label=DISCORD&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/finndog_123/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/CurseForge-projects-14822e?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge\" alt=\"CurseForge 專案\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fFinnDog_123\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Modrinth-projects-14822e?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth\" alt=\"Modrinth 專案\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpreviews.moogsmods.com%252fsoaring-structures%252f1.21.1%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://pub-24a4e0e7ea8544a5b6f73c3a23512589.r2.dev/images/c110cc09347a4f9f9de6c974f2fa35d8.png\" alt=\"查看結構\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Moogs_Soaring_Structure/BH_MSS_overview.webp\" alt=\"概述\"></p><p>此模組支援 Forge、Fabric、NeoForge 和 Quilt！也可僅安裝在伺服器端。Forge 支援在 1.20.4 版本後停止。</p><h3>關於</h3><p>Moogs Soaring Structures 為您的 Minecraft 世界注入生機、樂趣和多樣性！透過加入大量漂浮島嶼，內含酷炫建築與更多探索內容！探索以原版方塊和實體打造的全新絕妙結構，沿途發現戰利品、敵人和村民。此模組與任何模組包相容，甚至可以僅安裝在伺服器上！</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpreviews.moogsmods.com%252fsoaring-structures%252f1.21.1%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://pub-24a4e0e7ea8544a5b6f73c3a23512589.r2.dev/images/f8fe835413394a76b10a678afefea30f.png\" alt=\"即時 3D 瀏覽每個結構\"></a></p><p>想查看部分結構，請前往<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpreviews.moogsmods.com%252fsoaring-structures%252f1.21.1%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">預覽網站</a></p><h3>設定包</h3><p>模組的每個方面都可透過資料包自訂。內含完整說明的範本可在<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/mss-moogs-soaring-structure-config-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a>找到。</p><p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Moogs_Soaring_Structure/BH_MSS_features.webp\" alt=\"特色\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1040210/description_84b68622-1f45-4dd0-b110-ff18e67252ac.png\" alt=\"拼貼圖\"></p><h3>影片</h3><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/uiA_VsbAYgo?si=ytBXGNcAblSRa62-&amp;start=409\" width=\"320\" height=\"180\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/uWsSgXHbGwo?si=LIWDsyhLydDAFH5b&amp;start=567\" width=\"320\" height=\"180\"></iframe></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/DL5nGIa6K2Y?si=1_N6a2DM50MrtfJW\" width=\"320\" height=\"180\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h3>模組包</h3><p>查看所有模組包，請<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.modpackindex.com%252fmodpack%252ffinder%253fincluded_mods%253d61020\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">點此</a>。</p><p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Moogs_Soaring_Structure/BH_MSS_discord.webp\" alt=\"橫幅\"></p><p>獲得回覆最快的方式是加入我們的<a href=\"https://discord.gg/S5nffJbuvA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 伺服器</a>。</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fmoogsmods%253fr%253dcfmss\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Moogs_Soaring_Structure/BH_MSS_promo.webp\" alt=\"BH贊助\"></a></p>",
